  "question": {
    "text": "The image of an object placed in air formed by a convex refracting surface is at a distance of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> behind the surface. The image is real and is at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math> of the distance of the object from the surface. The wavelength of light inside the surface is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math> times the wavelength in air. The radius of the curved surface is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>13</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>,&nbsp;the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math> is&nbsp;______ .",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "30",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub><mi>&#956;</mi></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>&#956;</mi><mi>v</mi></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>u</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>R</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>15</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>R</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>30</mn><mn>13</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn></math></p>",
